'''Sail Fossil''' (Japanese: '''ヒレの化石''' ''Fin Fossil'') is an {{TCGP|Item}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Fantastical Parade}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Item
|rule=SWSH Item
|effect=Play this card as if it were a 40-HP Basic {{e|Colorless}} Pokémon.<br>At any time during your turn, you may discard this card from play.<br>This card can't retreat.
}}

==Trivia==

===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Furious Fists|Sail Fossil|98}} from the {{TCG|Furious Fists}} expansion.
*[[Sail Fossil]]s are [[fossil]]s in the [[Pokémon games]] which can be revived into {{p|Amaura}}.

